      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROTHWELL JACK (6) has missed the frame at his last two runs but could not have been more impressive the run prior in his head turning 22.53 win at Geelong over 400m. Can return to winning form here if runs up to best figures. MEPUNGA INFRARED (8) turned in a better effort at Warrnambool last start, finishing second behind Paw Christie (25.46) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Expected to feature again. GENESIS BALE (7) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.5 lengths (23.52) behind Spot The Angel at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. PAW SAUNDRA (1) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
